e="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">18&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection><selection id="qv6a7p6" name="Zarbag" entryId="8c93-5efa-f6de-1c3a::a654-dce1-1b78-a804" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="qvrqnic" name="Git Weapons" entryId="8c93-5efa-f6de-1c3a::317d-d326-cebe-25fa" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="55aa-eda5-8b5a-591b" name="Git Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="qw8e3bp" name="Champion" entryId="8c93-5efa-f6de-1c3a::021b-4e8f-9015-f89d::9c21-1746-9873-a5b5" entryGroupId="8c93-5efa-f6de-1c3a::ec75-1c22-1810-2e1e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Command Models"><profiles><profile id="cfed-845b-b46c-fc6d" name="Champion" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of weapons used by champions in this unit. If this unit is a **^^Beast^^**, this ability affects this unit's **Companion** weapons.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="9c77-5e0b-a20f-d885" name="Command Model" entryId="9c77-5e0b-a20f-d885" primary="false" /></categories></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="130" /></costs><categories><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /><category id="f679-3bcb-d664-9ac3" name="CHAMPION" entryId="f679-3bcb-d664-9ac3" primary="false" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="ce45-cc36-d92e-ef70" name="GLOOMSPITE GITZ" entryId="ce45-cc36-d92e-ef70" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" primary="true" /><category id="76e8-7818-115c-6899" name="MOONCLAN" entryId="76e8-7818-115c-6899" primary="false" /><category id="836d-96c5-f628-0692" name="Moonclan Infantry" entryId="836d-96c5-f628-0692" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="rd8ry0t" name="Aleguzzler Gargant" entryId="d9dc-1200-8e5f-ef7c::6774-35c0-997e-89c4" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ccae-c02e-6514-7427" name="Aleguzzler Gargant" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">12</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">10</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="fb00-2e91-6ab6-ec2d" name="Timberrrrr!" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">When this unit is destroyed, before removing it from play, the players must roll off. The winner picks a point on the battlefield within 3&quot; of this unit. Inflict D3 mortal damage on each unit (friendly and enemy) within 3&quot; of that point that has a lower Health characteristic than this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="7d20-cd5e-e039-a91a" name="Stuff 'Em in Me Bag" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn, Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. If the roll is at least double the target's Health characteristic, 1 model in the target unit is slain.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="rdlqxx" name="Aleguzzler Gargant" entryId="d9dc-1200-8e5f-ef7c::1044-ad8c-f950-43e4" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="rfufs9" name="'Eadbutt" entryId="d9dc-1200-8e5f-ef7c::5539-3285-142a-c7ea" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="6447-e07a-c938-a556" name="'Eadbutt" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="rftxyrf" name="Massive Club" entryId="d9dc-1200-8e5f-ef7c::f984-1bdc-305a-adfe" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4b97-b555-b084-5657" name="Massive Club" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="rfb29uk" name="Mighty Kick" entryId="d9dc-1200-8e5f-ef7c::2104-81a7-c997-4105" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1aa2-e928-b1a7-198d" name="Mighty Kick" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="rfo4ars" name="Throwin' Rocks" entryId="d9dc-1200-8e5f-ef7c::dd0b-22ff-7efb-fbc5" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1429-6ac1-a202-b523" name="Throwin' Rocks" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="150" /></costs><categories><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /><category id="ce45-cc36-d92e-ef70" name="GLOOMSPITE GITZ" entryId="ce45-cc36-d92e-ef70" primary="false" /><category id="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" name="DESTRUCTION" entryId="9057-5a29-dda5-3c28" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="sah705v" name="Arachnarok Spider with Flinger" entryId="6915-8142-d2e7-d35a::4b3e-a354-5e97-9d5a" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="df31-6a41-a8cd-9ab" name="Skitterstrand Arachnarok" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="f151-3adb-ad91-d69c" name="Flinger" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If any attacks made with this unit's **Flinger** score a hit, after the **^^Shoot^^** ability has been resolved, roll a dice. On a 2+, the target unit is **entangled** until the start of your next turn. Halve the Move characteristic of a unit while it is **entangled**.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Blue</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Shooting</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3588-8ea6-b50e-acd" name="Beast-binding Webbing" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit that charged this turn and is in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of the target's **Companion** weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="abfa-3e89-53c2-8773" name="Wall Crawler" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit can pass across terrain features as if it had **^^Fly^^**.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="sbk7gqq" name="Skitterstrand Arachnarok" entryId="6915-8142-d2e7-d35a::e6bb-108b-f0a9-b53d" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="sefhgkp" name="Chitinous Legs" entryId="6915-8142-d2e7-d35a::c6a4-4c5-74db-e40f" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2104-8d81-5e11-6809" name="Chitinous Legs" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847